          recv    proto              sysctl=0      sysctl=1     delta
          pi4-1   iperf3 TCP         936.37 Mb/s   936.38 Mb/s  +0.00 %
                  iperf3 UDP -l 64    97.89 Mb/s    98.26 Mb/s  +0.38 %
