          pi3-1   iperf3 TCP          93.83 Mb/s    93.81 Mb/s  -0.01 %
                  iperf3 UDP -l 64    29.54 Mb/s    29.88 Mb/s  +1.15 %
                  iperf2 TCP          93.85 Mb/s    93.85 Mb/s  +0.00 %

        Receiver CPU% delta (iperf3 reports cpu_recv): -0.0 to
